<title>JAPAN: Mikuni Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mikuni Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 59.59		vs	   55.55</p>
<p> Operating	    4.37		vs	    3.54</p>
<p> Current		4.64		vs	    3.86</p>
<p> Net		    2.44		vs	    2.15</p>
<p> EPS		   39.79 yen	  vs	   35.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     61 million	  vs	  61 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mikuni Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a large Coca-Cola bottler distributing north of Tokyo.</p>
</text>
